# -*- mode: sh -*-

# x-sailjail-description = Receive drone data from the CatSniffer
# x-sailjail-long-description = Allows harbour-idrone to receive decoded Remote ID
#   from an external CatSniffer via its least-privilege root system-service helper
#   (org.idrone.CatSniffer) over the system D-Bus. Receive-only; the app never
#   opens the device itself and the sniffer never transmits.

dbus-system.talk org.idrone.CatSniffer

# StartUnit/StopUnit for the helper unit (polkit-scoped).
dbus-system.talk org.freedesktop.systemd1
